tps://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-15T16:03:14Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T16:03:14Z","body":"> Fixes [godotengine/godot-docs#5894](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/5894).\r\n\r\nNote godotengine/godot-docs#5894 is an old issue, quoting the reported problem:\r\n\r\n> **3.4.4.stable.official**\r\n>\r\n> The documentation states that `get_closest_point(to_point)` method:\r\n>\r\n> _Returns **the closest baked point** (in curve's local space) to `to_point`._\r\n\r\nThe issue in question was already changed/clarified in #69115/#69239 by changing the docs to:\r\n> _Returns **the closest point on baked segments** (...)_\r\n\r\nSo AFAICT godotengine/godot-docs#5894 could be closed as is as resolved in `4.0`. Not sure if further clarification added in this PR is needed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4461331420/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4462681827","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119485#issuecomment-4462681827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119485","id":4462681827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCf8e4w","user":{"login":"alimetin05","id":69056001,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDU2MDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69056001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/us